            <note corresp="#d352-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d352-f1-content">
                <p>Source: National Archives, RG 59, Central Files
                    1950–1954, 788.00/12–1553. Secret; Security Information. The despatch was
                    drafted by Melbourne. There is no
                    drafting information on the enclosed memorandum of conversation. Received
                    December 28. Pouched to London.</p>
            </note>
